<div><div class="section-heading mb-4 container text-start" data-ste-element="Sites: Section Heading"><div><div class="row text-start"><div class="col col-md-8"><h2 class="header-focus"><span>Key benefits</span></h2></div></div></div></div><div class="container three-column-tile"><div class="row"><div data-ste-element="teaser" data-ste-teaser-type="tile" data-ste-teaser-title="Identify supply quality problems early" class="col-12 col-sm-12 col-md-6 col-lg-4 tileHeightAdjust"><div class="tile-flex-wrapper"><h3 class="strong tileHeading">Identify supply quality problems early</h3><div class="tileDescription"><p>Acquire comprehensive network parameters to identify supply quality problems proactively. Initiate swift measures to prevent serious consequences and reduce operational costs.</p></div></div></div><div data-ste-element="teaser" data-ste-teaser-type="tile" data-ste-teaser-title="Streamline operation and reporting" class="col-12 col-sm-12 col-md-6 col-lg-4 tileHeightAdjust"><div class="tile-flex-wrapper"><h3 class="strong tileHeading">Streamline operation and reporting</h3><div class="tileDescription"><p>Generate automatic PQ reports per EN 50160. Reduce manual effort and gain clear, standardized documentation for PQ analysis.</p></div></div></div><div data-ste-element="teaser" data-ste-teaser-type="tile" data-ste-teaser-title="Ensure interoperability and data exchange" class="col-12 col-sm-12 col-md-6 col-lg-4 tileHeightAdjust"><div class="tile-flex-wrapper"><h3 class="strong tileHeading">Ensure interoperability and data exchange</h3><div class="tileDescription"><p>Achieve interoperability with standard interfaces. Exchange data using PQDIF and COMTRADE formats. Gain manufacturer-independent, comparable measured values for flexible system integration.</p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div id='1QodQNx3iahpSVDyGfwLWv' class='sitesCardsContainer themed-component-wrapper' data-ste-section='cards-container_3' data-ste-section-id='1QodQNx3iahpSVDyGfwLWv'><is-land on:visible><div id="comp-1QodQNx3iahpSVDyGfwLWv" class="CardsContainer" data-component-type="CardsContainer"><section id="1QodQNx3iahpSVDyGfwLWv" class="cards-defaultBackground" role="region" aria-labelledby="section-heading-1QodQNx3iahpSVDyGfwLWv"><div class="section-heading mb-4 container text-start" data-ste-element="Sites: Section Heading"><div><div class="row text-start"><div class="col col-md-8"><h2 class="header-focus"><span>Featured capabilities</span></h2></div></div></div></div><div class="container"><div class="row cards-container-row"><div class="siemens-cards col-md-4"><div data-ste-element="teaser" data-ste-teaser-type="card" data-ste-teaser-title="Acquire and process electrical variables" id="G_Acquire%20and%20process%20electrical%20variables-0" class="card blogWrapNoLink rounded-0" role="article" aria-labelledby="G_Acquire%20and%20process%20electrical%20variables-0-title" aria-describedby="G_Acquire%20and%20process%20electrical%20variables-0-desc" tabindex="0"><div class="imageWrapper"></div><div class="card-body d-flex flex-column p-3"><strong class="text-kicker pb-2 mb-0 text-color"></strong><div class="category d-none">all</div><h3 id="G_Acquire%20and%20process%20electrical%20variables-0-title" class="pb-4 mb-0">Acquire and process electrical variables</h3><div id="G_Acquire%20and%20process%20electrical%20variables-0-desc" class="text-black card-text pb-3 mb-0"><div><p>Collect, display and transmit electrical variables: AC current, voltage, power types and harmonics. Process measurands and events per IEC 61000-4-30, including flicker, for precise, compliant data acquisition.</p></div></div><div data-area="card-info-section" class="d-flex flex-column justify-content-end h-100"></div></div></div></div><div class="siemens-cards col-md-4"><div data-ste-element="teaser" data-ste-teaser-type="card" data-ste-teaser-title="Use standard communication protocols" id="G_Use%20standard%20communication%20protocols-1" class="card blogWrapNoLink rounded-0